/-!
# A322426

Array read by downwards antidiagonals: A(n, k) is the k-th term of a "Look to the left" sequence starting with 1,2,...,n  (see A293630).

The 87 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `2`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A322426

/-- Known terms of `flat`, starting at index `2`. -/
def flatData : List flatRetType :=
  [1, 2, 1, 1, 2, 1, 1, 3, 2, 1,
    1, 1, 3, 2, 1, 2, 2, 4, 3, 2,
    1, 1, 1, 1, 4, 3, 2, 1, 1, 2,
